      "reason": "Task 14B requires forward-only guarded PostgreSQL authority for durable pre-dispatch EmbeddingJob cancellation and definite failure. Historical migrations through 0191 cannot be edited; the preceding user-facing request identified this exact new migration and the 105-to-106 scope delta.",
